  "updated_at": "2026-01-15T20:51:57.243192+00:00",
  "source": "https://doi.org/10.1016/0378-4290(94)90005-1",
  "reference": "Monteith, J.L. (1977) Climate and the efficiency of crop production. Phil. Trans. R. Soc. B 281:277-294"
}